Othello is [[People/Anzu|Anzu]]'s raven familiar. The first Othello was a raven that flew and hunted with Anzu, who could look through his eyes and send him simple directions in reply. He was killed by fire in the hall beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]].

Anzu took a pet-shop bird and rewired its mind with his psychic power until it held Othello's memories and answered to his name, so the familiar lives on in a new body. He says Othello is more an idea than an individual.
